    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Prayer for Restoration"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director: according to “The Lilies.” A testimony of Asaph. A psalm."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Listen, Shepherd of Israel,",
          "who leads Joseph like a flock;",
          "you who sit enthroned between the cherubim,",
          "shine"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "on Ephraim,",
          "Benjamin, and Manasseh.",
          "Rally your power and come to save us."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Restore us, God;",
          "make your face shine on us,",
          "so that we may be saved."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord God of Armies,",
          "how long will you be angry",
          "with your people’s prayers?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You fed them the bread of tears",
          "and gave them a full measure",
          "of tears to drink."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You put us at odds with our neighbors;",
          "our enemies mock us."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Restore us, God of Armies;",
          "make your face shine on us, so that we may be saved."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You dug up a vine from Egypt;",
          "you drove out the nations and planted it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You cleared a place for it;",
          "it took root and filled the land."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The mountains were covered by its shade,",
          "and the mighty cedars with its branches."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "It sent out sprouts toward the Sea",
          "and shoots toward the River. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Why have you broken down its walls",
          "so that all who pass by pick its fruit?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Boars from the forest tear at it",
          "and creatures of the field feed on it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Return, God of Armies.",
          "Look down from heaven and see;",
          "take care of this vine,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the root your right hand planted,",
          "the son that you made strong for yourself."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "It was cut down and burned;",
          "they perish at the rebuke of your countenance."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let your hand be with the man at your right hand,",
          "with the son of man",
          "you have made strong for yourself."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then we will not turn away from you;",
          "revive us, and we will call on your name."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Restore us, Lord, God of Armies;",
          "make your face shine on us, so that we may be saved."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
